    "author": "Arnold Schoenberg",
    "description": "Reproduction study — inspired by Arnold Schoenberg's untitled system (1924). Major-third staff at C/E/G# with bold C lines; the three inter-line elevations are marked by a slash on the left (/o), through the centre (𝜙), and on the right (o/), baked into per-pitch-class oval variants (operator UAT reference shapes o, /o, 𝜙, o/). Slash geometry is an approximation of the published marks. Built from the public gallery description/image; not endorsed by or derived from the original.",
